  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1634.03 Classification-Blasting Agent. Water gels containing no substance in itself classified as an explosive and which are not cap-sensitive as defined in Saf-C 1602.06, shall be classified as blasting agents and manufactured, transported, stored, and used in the same manner specified for blasting agents in these rules.\n\nSource. #2220, eff 12-31-82; ss by #2837, eff 8-27-84; ss by #4584, eff 3-3-89; ss by #5996, INTERIM, eff 3-3-95, EXPIRES, 7-1-95; ss by #6054, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03\n\nNew. #8116, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRES: 1-10-05; ss by #8231, eff 12-20-04; ss by #10396, eff 8-15-13",
